research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-t1-compactness-core.log:4927:   138	**For a metrizable space the picture collapses.** Compactness, countable compactness, sequential compactness and limit point compactness are all equivalent there ([[thm-metric-compactness-equivalences]]), at a choice cost recorded arrow by arrow in [[rem-compactness-choice-ledger-metric]]; the implications proved without choice in the metric setting are [[thm-compact-implies-the-other-compactness-forms]]. Nothing in that collapse is available here, and the counterexamples of this page are all non-metrizable.
